::  name       dimeroll intake field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  a DimerollReceiptIntake carries exactly seven fields
::             (receipt_id - source_fact - evidence_status - offered_value -
::             value_unit - recognition_status - journal_entry_count)
::  example    7
::  readers    Mantra - Glow Tend - Sur museum - Patchouli weave
::  nib        equinox-e208-mantra-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e208 - Mantra M9 -- ninth Mantra structure pedestal in src/shape/.
::  Names DimerollReceiptIntake's field count from
::  mantra/src/dimeroll_receipt_offer.rye, the receipt contract's evidence-
::  only projection (case 2's sibling): an offer is evidence, not a journal
::  entry, so `recognition_status` reads `unrecognized-offer` and
::  `journal_entry_count` reads 0 for this milestone. Pedestal only; Rye
::  still owns the projection function and its own comptime assert.
::
::  Seven sits under rune_shape.max_fields (15); this pedestal does not
::  raise it. Smaller than the eleven-field Linengrow receipt by design --
::  evidence names a source and a status rather than restating the offer's
::  own terms.
+$  dimeroll-intake-field-count-shape
  $:  fields=@u32
  ==
